    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Human (Erectus)</em> at level 17; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You were never supposed to stop.”</em></p><p><strong>First Fire (1/Long Rest).</strong> When you would drop to 0 hit points, you instead drop to 1 hit point and gain temporary hit points equal to twice your proficiency bonus. Also, allies who can see you gain advantage on their next saving throw (because you refuse to quit and it's fucking inspiring).</p>",
